// * GB3: CR × LF
//   There's no point in us handling this, because in our implementation
//   the text buffer won't ever see these control characters to begin with.
// * GB9c: \p{InCB=Consonant} [ \p{InCB=Extend} \p{InCB=Linker} ]* \p{InCB=Linker} [ \p{InCB=Extend} \p{InCB=Linker} ]* × \p{InCB=Consonant}
